DTSTART:20270105T063000
DTEND:20270105T071500
SUMMARY:[RW] Tempo ride (3 x 8 min) (45 min)
DESCRIPTION:12 min warm-up\; 3 x (8 min tempo + 4 min easy)\; 8 min cool-d
 own. Tempo is comfortably hard (RPE 6\, about 76-90 % of FTP). Even power
 \, seated.\n\nWeek 7 (BUILD). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how 
 you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2027-01-06-bike3-easy-ride@rampwise
DTSTAMP:20261117T003912Z
DTSTART:20270106T063000
DTEND:20270106T071500
SUMMARY:[RW] Easy ride (45 min)
DESCRIPTION:10 min warm-up\; 27 min easy\; 8 min cool-down. Mostly steady 
 endurance (RPE 2-3\, 56-75 % of FTP if you use power). Eat and drink on r
 ides over 90 minutes.\n\nWeek 7 (BUILD). Not medical advice\; pain that c
 hanges how you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
