 down. Tempo is comfortably hard (RPE 6\, about 76-90 % of FTP). Even powe
 r\, seated. Practise your race fuelling on rides over 90 minutes.\n\nWeek
  7 (BUILD). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how you move means sto
 p.\nrampwise-plan
